---
import {
  adiabaticModelDefaults,
  diagonalDerivativeScale,
  localAdiabaticityIndicator,
  sampleAvoidedCrossing,
  twoLevelAdiabaticState,
} from '../../../data/part07/adiabaticCouplingModel.mjs';

const minR = adiabaticModelDefaults.coordinateRange[0];
const maxR = adiabaticModelDefaults.coordinateRange[1];
const xToSvg = (coordinate) => 58 + (524 * (coordinate - minR)) / (maxR - minR);
const yToSvg = (energy) => 246 - ((energy + 3.3) * 196) / 6.6;
const toPath = (samples, key) => samples
  .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xToSvg(point.coordinate).toFixed(2)} ${yToSvg(point[key]).toFixed(2)}`)
  .join(' ');
const defaultSamples = sampleAvoidedCrossing();
const lowerPath = toPath(defaultSamples, 'lower');
const upperPath = toPath(defaultSamples, 'upper');
const fallbackRows = [0.1, 0.3, 0.8].map((coupling) => {
  const state = twoLevelAdiabaticState(0, { coupling });
  return {
    coupling,
    gap: state.gap,
    derivativeCoupling: state.derivativeCoupling,
    indicator: localAdiabaticityIndicator({ coupling, velocity: 0.05 }),
  };
});
---

<figure class="chapter-visual avoided-crossing" data-avoided-crossing>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：avoided crossing、能隙与导数耦合</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: avoided crossing, gap, and derivative coupling</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls avoided-crossing__controls">
    <label>
      <span>非对角耦合 Δ | Off-diagonal coupling Δ</span>
      <input type="range" min="0.05" max="1" step="0.01" value={adiabaticModelDefaults.coupling} data-ac-coupling />
      <output data-ac-coupling-output>{adiabaticModelDefaults.coupling.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>核速度 v | Nuclear velocity v</span>
      <input type="range" min="0" max="0.2" step="0.005" value={adiabaticModelDefaults.velocity} data-ac-velocity />
      <output data-ac-velocity-output>{adiabaticModelDefaults.velocity.toFixed(3)}</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 295" role="img" aria-labelledby="ac-title ac-desc">
    <title id="ac-title">Two-level avoided crossing with adjustable coupling</title>
    <desc id="ac-desc">
      Two diabatic straight lines cross at zero coordinate. A nonzero off-diagonal coupling produces upper and lower adiabatic surfaces with a minimum gap. Decreasing the gap increases the derivative coupling.
    </desc>
    <line x1="58" y1="246" x2="582" y2="246" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="58" y1="40" x2="58" y2="246" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1={xToSvg(0)} y1="40" x2={xToSvg(0)} y2="246" class="plot-guide" />
    <path d={`M ${xToSvg(-3)} ${yToSvg(-3)} L ${xToSvg(3)} ${yToSvg(3)}`} class="avoided-crossing__diabatic" />
    <path d={`M ${xToSvg(-3)} ${yToSvg(3)} L ${xToSvg(3)} ${yToSvg(-3)}`} class="avoided-crossing__diabatic" />
    <path d={lowerPath} class="avoided-crossing__lower" data-ac-lower />
    <path d={upperPath} class="avoided-crossing__upper" data-ac-upper />
    <line
      x1={xToSvg(0)}
      y1={yToSvg(-adiabaticModelDefaults.coupling)}
      x2={xToSvg(0)}
      y2={yToSvg(adiabaticModelDefaults.coupling)}
      class="avoided-crossing__gap"
      data-ac-gap-line
    />
    <text x="582" y="272" text-anchor="end">R</text>
    <text x="24" y="48">E</text>
    <text x={xToSvg(0) + 9} y={yToSvg(0) - 8} data-ac-gap-label>gap = 0.60</text>
    <text x="430" y="68" class="avoided-crossing__legend-upper">E₊(R)</text>
    <text x="430" y="222" class="avoided-crossing__legend-lower">E₋(R)</text>
    <text x="430" y="145" class="avoided-crossing__legend-diabatic">diabatic ±aR</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>最小能隙 | Minimum gap:</span>
    <strong data-ac-min-gap>2Δ = 0.600000</strong>
    <span>交叉点导数耦合 | Derivative coupling at R=0:</span>
    <strong data-ac-derivative>d₋₊ = 1.666667</strong>
    <span>局域混合指标 | Local mixing indicator:</span>
    <strong data-ac-indicator>v|d|/gap = 0.138889</strong>
    <span>质量抑制尺度 | Mass-suppressed derivative scale:</span>
    <strong data-ac-mass-scale>|d|²/(2M) = 0.000756</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="avoided-crossing__fallback">
    <p><strong>无 JavaScript 参考表 | No-JavaScript reference table</strong></p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Δ</th><th>min gap</th><th>|d(0)|</th><th>v|d|/gap, v=0.05</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {fallbackRows.map((row) => (
          <tr>
            <td>{row.coupling.toFixed(2)}</td>
            <td>{row.gap.toFixed(6)}</td>
            <td>{row.derivativeCoupling.toFixed(6)}</td>
            <td>{row.indicator.toFixed(6)}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>Hₑ(R)=aR σz+Δ σx</code>，默认 <code>a=1</code>、<code>Δ=0.3</code>，所有量为无量纲教学变量。绝热能量为 <code>E±=±sqrt((aR)²+Δ²)</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>Hₑ(R)=aR σz+Δ σx</code>, with default <code>a=1</code> and <code>Δ=0.3</code>; all quantities are dimensionless teaching variables. The adiabatic energies are <code>E±=±sqrt((aR)²+Δ²)</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>解析验收：</strong>最小能隙为 <code>2Δ</code>；<code>|d₋₊(R)|=aΔ/[2((aR)²+Δ²)]</code>；势导数矩阵元除以能隙等于该导数耦合的模。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Analytic acceptance:</strong> the minimum gap is <code>2Δ</code>; <code>|d₋₊(R)|=aΔ/[2((aR)²+Δ²)]</code>; and the potential-derivative matrix element divided by the gap equals the derivative-coupling magnitude.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong><code>v|d|/gap</code> 只是局域量纲化混合指标，不是 Landau–Zener 概率、真实跃迁率或材料 EPC。真实判断还需要轨迹、相位、全部态和时间尺度。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> <code>v|d|/gap</code> is a local dimensionless mixing indicator, not a Landau-Zener probability, transition rate, or material EPC. A real judgment requires a trajectory, phases, all relevant states, and time scales.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    adiabaticModelDefaults,
    diagonalDerivativeScale,
    localAdiabaticityIndicator,
    sampleAvoidedCrossing,
    twoLevelAdiabaticState,
  } from '../../../data/part07/adiabaticCouplingModel.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-avoided-crossing]').forEach((root) => {
    const couplingInput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-coupling]');
    const velocityInput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-velocity]');
    const couplingOutput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-coupling-output]');
    const velocityOutput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-velocity-output]');
    const lowerCurve = root.querySelector('[data-ac-lower]');
    const upperCurve = root.querySelector('[data-ac-upper]');
    const gapLine = root.querySelector('[data-ac-gap-line]');
    const gapLabel = root.querySelector('[data-ac-gap-label]');
    const minGapOutput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-min-gap]');
    const derivativeOutput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-derivative]');
    const indicatorOutput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-indicator]');
    const massScaleOutput = root.querySelector('[data-ac-mass-scale]');
    if (!(couplingInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)
      || !(velocityInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)
      || !(lowerCurve instanceof SVGPathElement)
      || !(upperCurve instanceof SVGPathElement)
      || !(gapLine instanceof SVGLineElement)) return;

    const minR = adiabaticModelDefaults.coordinateRange[0];
    const maxR = adiabaticModelDefaults.coordinateRange[1];
    const xToSvg = (coordinate) => 58 + (524 * (coordinate - minR)) / (maxR - minR);
    const yToSvg = (energy) => 246 - ((energy + 3.3) * 196) / 6.6;
    const pathFor = (samples, key) => samples
      .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${xToSvg(point.coordinate).toFixed(2)} ${yToSvg(point[key]).toFixed(2)}`)
      .join(' ');

    const update = () => {
      const coupling = Number(couplingInput.value);
      const velocity = Number(velocityInput.value);
      if (!Number.isFinite(coupling) || !Number.isFinite(velocity)) return;
      const samples = sampleAvoidedCrossing({ coupling });
      const state = twoLevelAdiabaticState(0, { coupling });
      const indicator = localAdiabaticityIndicator({ coupling, velocity });
      const massScale = diagonalDerivativeScale({ coupling });
      lowerCurve.setAttribute('d', pathFor(samples, 'lower'));
      upperCurve.setAttribute('d', pathFor(samples, 'upper'));
      gapLine.setAttribute('y1', yToSvg(-coupling).toFixed(2));
      gapLine.setAttribute('y2', yToSvg(coupling).toFixed(2));
      if (gapLabel instanceof SVGTextElement) {
        gapLabel.setAttribute('y', (yToSvg(0) - 8).toFixed(2));
        gapLabel.textContent = `gap = ${state.gap.toFixed(2)}`;
      }
      if (couplingOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) couplingOutput.value = coupling.toFixed(2);
      if (velocityOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) velocityOutput.value = velocity.toFixed(3);
      if (minGapOutput instanceof HTMLElement) minGapOutput.textContent = `2Δ = ${state.gap.toFixed(6)}`;
      if (derivativeOutput instanceof HTMLElement) derivativeOutput.textContent = `d₋₊ = ${state.derivativeCoupling.toFixed(6)}`;
      if (indicatorOutput instanceof HTMLElement) indicatorOutput.textContent = `v|d|/gap = ${indicator.toFixed(6)}`;
      if (massScaleOutput instanceof HTMLElement) massScaleOutput.textContent = `|d|²/(2M) = ${massScale.toFixed(6)}`;
    };

    couplingInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    velocityInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .avoided-crossing {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__controls {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.8rem 1rem;
  }

  .avoided-crossing svg {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 35rem;
  }

  .avoided-crossing text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__diabatic {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 6 5;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__lower,
  .avoided-crossing__upper {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 3;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__lower {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
  }

  .avoided-crossing__upper {
    stroke: currentColor;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__gap {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 3;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__legend-upper,
  .avoided-crossing__legend-lower,
  .avoided-crossing__legend-diabatic {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__fallback {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .avoided-crossing__fallback table {
    width: 100%;
  }
</style>
